cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HybridRoute in research or engineering work, please cite this software."
title: "HybridRoute: Policy-Aware Semantic API Routing"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tavakkoli
    given-names: Vahid
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vtavakkoli/HybridRoute"
url: "https://github.com/vtavakkoli/HybridRoute"
abstract: >-
  HybridRoute is a gateway-independent semantic API router written in Rust.
  It combines policy filtering, BM25 lexical retrieval, deterministic
  approximate-nearest-neighbour retrieval, embeddings, metadata, schema
  compatibility, route health, and bounded quality signals to select APIs,
  services, workflows, or AI endpoints.
keywords:
  - semantic routing
  - API gateway
  - reverse proxy
  - embeddings
  - Rust
